nguage": "en"}]}], "tavat": [{"id": "tAvat", "headword": "तावत्", "headword_slp1": "tAvat", "fold": "tavat", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "ता॑वत् mf(अती)n. (fr. 2. त, Pāṇ. v, 2, 39; vi, 3, 91) so great, so large, so much, so far, so long, so many (correlative of या॑वत्; rarely of य or यथोक्त, Nal. &c.), RV. &c. (यावता क्षणेन तावता, ‘after so long time, in that time’, as soon as, Rājat. v, 110)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "just a little, Kir. ii, 48", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(in alg.) an unknown quantity (also with यावत्)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "ता॑वत् ind. (correlative of या॑वत्) so much, so greatly, to such an extent, in such a number, so far, RV.; AV. &c. (ता॑वत्-तावत्, ŚBr. i, 8, 1, 6)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "so long, in that time, RV. x, 88, 19; ŚBr. i; Mn. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "meanwhile, in the mean time (the correlative यावत् being often connected with a neg., e.g. तावच् छोभते मूर्खो यावत् किं-चिन् न भाषते, ‘so long a fool shines as long as he says nothing’, Hit.; शोचयिष्याम्य् आत्मानं तावद् यावन् मे प्राप्तम् ब्राह्मण्यम्, ‘so long I will emaciate myself, as long as [i.e. until] I have obtained the state of a Brāhman’, R. i, 64, 19), ŚBr. xiv, 4, 2, 30; ChUp. vi, 14, 2; Mn.; MBh. &c. (also correlative of पुरा [R. i, 28, 21], of यावता न, of यावत् preceded by पुरा [MBh. xiii, 4556], or without any correlative [2727; Kathās.; Hit.])", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "at once, now, just, first (followed by अनन्तरम् [Hit.], अपरम् [Pañcat.], अपि [ib.], इदानीम् [Hit.], उत [Śak.], च [Daś.; Prab.], ततस् [Mn. iv, 174; Ragh. vii, 4 f.], तद्-अनु [Megh.], तु [Daś. vii; Vedāntas.], पश्चात् [R. ii], पुनर् [Pañcat.], वा; very often connected with an Impv., rarely [MBh. iv, 888; R. ii, 56, 13] with a Pot., often with the 1st person of pr. or fut. MBh. &c.; the Impv. is sometimes to be supplied [इतस् तावत्, ‘just come hither’; मा तावत्, ‘by no means, God forbid!’] Śak.; Mālav.; Vikr.; Prab.; sometimes अर्हसि with the inf. is used instead, R. i f.)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(with न or अ-) not yet, MBh. &c. (followed by यावत्, ‘while’, Kathās. xxvi, 23; तावन् न-अपि न, ‘not only not-but also not’, Kād.)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "very well, all right, Hcar.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "indeed, truly (e.g. दृढस् तावद् बन्धः, ‘the knot is tight I must admit’, Hit.; गता तावत्, ‘she is indeed gone’, Kathās. xviii, 241), R. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "already (opposed to ‘how much more’ or ‘how much less’), R. iv f.; Śak.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "really (= एव, sometimes connected with this particle, e.g. विक्रयस् तावद् एव सः, ‘it is really a sale’), Mn. iii, 53; Hariv. 7110; R. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "तावत् [cf. Lat. tantus.]", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तावन्त्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tAvant"]}], "tavata": [{"id": "tAvatA", "headword": "तावता", "headword_slp1": "tAvatA", "fold": "tavata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "ता॑वता (ता), instr. ind. to that extent, RPrāt. xiii, 13; BhP. v, viii", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "in that time, in the mean time, meanwhile, Daś.; Kathās. x, 24; Bharaṭ.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tavati": [{"id": "tAvati", "headword": "तावति", "headword_slp1": "tAvati", "fold": "tavati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "ता॑वति (ति), loc. ind. so far, ŚBr. viii, 6, 2, 8", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "so long, in that time, TS. ii, 4;", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tavatkalam": [{"id": "tAvatkAlam", "headword": "तावत्कालम्", "headword_slp1": "tAvatkAlam", "fold": "tavatkalam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "तावत्—कालम् ind. for so long, Kauś. 141; MBh. iii; Hit.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tavatkftvas": [{"id": "tAvatkftvas", "headword": "तावत्कृत्वस्", "headword_slp1": "tAvatkftvas",